r search...\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t<CommandList>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<CommandEmpty>No results found.</CommandEmpty>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<CommandGroup heading=\"Quick start\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<FolderPlusIcon\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsize={16}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassName=\"opacity-60\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>New folder</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandShortcut className=\"justify-center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⌘N\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandShortcut>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<FileInputIcon\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsize={16}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassName=\"opacity-60\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Import document</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandShortcut className=\"justify-center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⌘I\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandShortcut>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<CircleFadingPlusIcon\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsize={16}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassName=\"opacity-60\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Add block</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandShortcut className=\"justify-center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⌘B\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandShortcut>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</CommandGroup>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<CommandSeparator />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<CommandGroup heading=\"Navigation\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsize={16}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassName=\"opacity-60\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Go to dashboard</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsize={16}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassName=\"opacity-60\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Go to apps</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsize={16}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassName=\"opacity-60\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Go to connections</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</CommandItem>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</CommandGroup>\r\n\t\t\t\t</CommandList>\r\n\t\t\t</CommandDialog>\r\n\t\t</>\r\n\t);\r\n}\r\n",
